GW100 controller-level media lifecycle

Allow deferred startup after firmware training, bounded local media drain,
self-refresh retention and reset using the native rank scheduler.
Default DRAMInterface behavior remains compatible. Validated by the
Memory Tile timing probe and firmware lifecycle regressions.

